          <p class="sec-desc">Not whole books—the specific chapters that sit in the same semantic neighborhood as your last session. A volume can appear here for forty pages and nowhere else.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chapters-grid" id="chapters-rail">
        {initialChapters.map((ch) => (
